<% if @locale == "en" -%>
Hi <%= @order.shipping_first_name.presence || @order.customer_name %>,

Your order <%= @order.order_number %> arrived a few days ago. If you have a minute, tell other parents what you think. Every review on our site comes from a customer who actually bought the bundle.

<% @links.each do |link| -%>
<%= link[:name] %>: <%= link[:url] %>
<% end -%>

Each link works once and is valid until <%= @expires_on.strftime("%-d %B %Y") %>. We show your first name and the initial of your last name next to the review, and only after we check it.

Thank you!
Luna Baby Team
<% else -%>
Pozdrav <%= @order.shipping_first_name.presence || @order.customer_name %>,

Vaša narudžba <%= @order.order_number %> stigla je prije nekoliko dana. Ako imate minutu, recite drugim roditeljima što mislite. Sve recenzije na našoj stranici pišu kupci koji su paket stvarno kupili.

<% @links.each do |link| -%>
<%= link[:name] %>: <%= link[:url] %>
<% end -%>

Svaka poveznica vrijedi jednom, do <%= @expires_on.strftime("%d.%m.%Y.") %> Uz recenziju prikazujemo vaše ime i početno slovo prezimena, i to tek nakon što je pregledamo.

Hvala vam!
Luna Baby tim
<% end -%>
